ice-Chair\nLois Zarish\nFormer HCDC Chairwoman & Raritan Twp Municipal Democratic Vice-Chair\nCarla Brkich\nTown of Clinton Democratic Committeewoman\nKent Davis\nRaritan Twp Democratic Club President and Democratic County Committeeman\nRaina Filipiak\nRaritan Twp Democratic Committeewoman\nMegan Johnson\nTown of Clinton Democratic Committeewoman\nJacob Kaplan\nFrenchtown Democratic Committeeman\nJohn Tompkins\nBernards Township Committeeman\nDominic Puzio\nHCDC Exec. Committeeman and Raritan Twp Democratic Committeeman\nAlison Roberts\nTown of Clinton Democratic Committeewoman\nJoe Zarish\nRaritan Twp Democratic Committeeman\nMarjorie Fox\nFormer Summit Council President\nPhyllis Sank\nFormer Summit Council Member\nJordan Glatt\nFormer Summit Mayor\nFred Ferry\nFormer High Bridge Democratic Chair\nAlan Harwick\nFormer HCDC Vice-Chair and Former Readington Twp Municipal Chair\nLorraine Parker\nSparta Democratic Committee Member & Ret. NJ Superior Court Judge\n### JOin Our Team\n### Let's Win This Race – Together:\nBy participating with your mobile number, you agree to terms & privacy policy and consent to receive messages to support Rebecca Bennett (messages include donation links). Message & data rates may apply. Message frequency varies. Text HELP for help, Text STOP to Opt Out.\nDonate\nVolunteer\nDonate\nwith Numero\nDonate\nwith ActBlue\nA former U.S. Navy helicopter pilot, officer in the Air National Guard, business leader in healthcare, and mother of two, Rebecca Bennett is running for Congress in New Jersey’s 7th Congressional District. Currently held by a Republican, this district is one of the most competitive in the nation and a must-win for Democrats to take back the House in 2026. Support Rebecca’s campaign by signing up to volunteer or donating today.\nFacebook\nX-twitter\nThreads\nInstagram\nYoutube\n### Contact The Campaign\ninfo@rebeccabennettforcongress.com\n### Contributions can be mailed to:\n### Rebecca Bennett for Congress\nPO Box 139\nSomervil